# Trim the bundled dataset to just the hero case (Yaris) + one no-catalogue
# example (Holden Barina), to stay well under serverless function size
# limits. Full dataset is 510MB; this keeps it to ~70MB. The app degrades
# gracefully (freeform identification) for any vehicle whose data is
# missing, so trimming the rest is safe, not just fast.
